@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-71 - View Open Conversations

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Chat Widget / Admin Chat UI" as FE
control "ChatController" as API
control "ChatService" as Service
database "MongoDB: chatConversations" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-71
FE -> API: GET /chat/conversations?status=open
API -> Service: Execute View Open Conversations
Service -> DB: Read/write chatConversations
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Danh sách conversations hiển thị

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đăng nhập với role admin/manager
Post: Danh sách conversations hiển thị
Main flow:
1. Admin vào /admin/chat
2. System gọi API GET /chat/conversations?status=open
3. System trả về danh sách: convId, userName, lastMessage,\nunreadForManager, updatedAt
4. Highlight conversations có unread > 0
end note
@enduml
